  "body": "## Reproduced; actual-merge certification pending\n\nv16.48 extends the non-stacking repair theorem to every finite internal chain, under the frozen admission and independent-barrier definitions. The compact-palette induction repairs each subtree with its root support fixed, contracts unused labels, and transports saturated roles without simultaneous ancestor defects. The general statement rests on independent proof review; finite audits validate the implementation. Arbitrary internal branching and universal retained-tree unit barriers remain unresolved.\n\n- Verified parent: `8bbd51984ad6be923bbcb05e903fe39874f05cf9`.\n- Prospective preregistration: `614a5e29684b648ce8e75bfaad5f3668abe95d45`, direct child of the verified parent.\n- [Prospective RED](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36854081813) at `c3a0adf2da1177bcf8786f9cb11f6c7fe5a560bf`: both expected assertion failures retained, before implementation.\n- Reviewed source: `9d7e7bbbd21539954650d863af3c318e20eea0e0`.\n- [Full science and independent reproduction](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36854989777): all jobs SUCCESS, including evidence publication.\n- Outcome: **CHAIN_INDUCTION_VALIDATED**. Six complete graphs, 38,278 states, 224,656 edges, 42 profiles, 142 component pairs; 106 representative normalizations. All 210 directed constructions pass, including repeated saturation and depth8.\n- Zero construction failures; zero nonunit pairs.\n- 845 passing checks: 762 inherited + 83 new. Fresh complete parent47/nested science. All30 scientific files reproduce byte-for-byte.\n- Source artifacts bind 1,660 source/input paths to 1,401 unique objects and exact Git blobs; 82 execution manifest members. Full raw artifact archives retained. Independent audit verified all 216 publication manifest members and separate-runner scientific-byte agreement.\n- Exact publication head: `c59ac995ce0520f3397582123ab2cd922f59481f`; tree `3cfc0a9a81951c48e1783be601b1f36c3ba8d531`.\n\nThe directed corpus is not exhaustive enumeration for its larger palettes. Primary B1/Binf/Bs remain independent scalar minima, with LEX separate. No arbitrary-tree or physical interpretation is claimed. Exact-head merge is complete at `0c0efebe7f1b6c0eafbde744621f7b1f7bef117e`; ordered parents and publication-tree equality have been verified. [Actual-merge replay](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36856450558), durable receipt and independent final audit remain required before CLOSED/CERTIFIED.\n",
